(Orbital Payments API - Reference \(v2.4\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Authentication) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(All requests must include a bearer token in the Authorization header.) Tj T*
(Tokens are issued by POST /v2/auth/token and expire after 3600 seconds.) Tj T*
(Refresh tokens are valid for 30 days and are single-use: each refresh) Tj T*
(invalidates the previous refresh token.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Requests without a valid token return HTTP 401 with error code) Tj T*
(auth_token_invalid. Requests with an expired token return HTTP 401 with) Tj T*
(error code auth_token_expired.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Rate Limiting) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The default rate limit is 120 requests per minute per API key. Bulk) Tj T*
(endpoints under /v2/bulk/ have a separate limit of 10 requests per minute.) Tj T*
(Exceeding a limit returns HTTP 429 with a Retry-After header expressed in) Tj T*
(seconds. The limit can be raised to 600 requests per minute on the) Tj T*
(Enterprise plan by contacting support.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Rate limit state is reported on every response through three headers:) Tj T*
(X-RateLimit-Limit, X-RateLimit-Remaining, and X-RateLimit-Reset.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
