(Orbital Payments API - Reference \(v2.4\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Payouts) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(POST /v2/payouts creates a payout. Required fields are amount_cents) Tj T*
(\(integer\), currency \(ISO 4217\), and destination_id \(string\). The optional) Tj T*
(idempotency_key field prevents duplicate payouts when a request is retried;) Tj T*
(keys are retained for 24 hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GET /v2/payouts/{payout_id} retrieves a single payout.) Tj T*
(GET /v2/payouts lists payouts, paginated with limit \(max 100\) and cursor.) Tj T*
(POST /v2/payouts/{payout_id}/cancel cancels a payout that is still pending.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A payout moves through the states: pending, processing, paid, failed,) Tj T*
(cancelled. Only payouts in the pending state can be cancelled.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Webhooks) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Webhook payloads are signed with HMAC-SHA256 using your endpoint secret.) Tj T*
(The signature is sent in the X-Orbital-Signature header. Verify it before) Tj T*
(trusting the payload. Failed deliveries are retried 8 times with) Tj T*
(exponential backoff over roughly 24 hours.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Supported events: payout.created, payout.paid, payout.failed,) Tj T*
(payout.cancelled, and account.updated.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
